# LLM boundary (Orion)

When editing these files:

- Return structured JSON to callers; keep scoring and catalog logic out of prompts.
- Unit tests use fixtures — no live Ollama required for parse/retry tests.
- Do not invent beer names or style IDs in outputs consumed by the recommender.
- Retry malformed JSON once; surface failures to the UI layer.

If the ticket also changes confidence or catalog behavior, stop and split — Engine owns that logic.
